  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><p data-lake-id=\"ub359b93f\" id=\"ub359b93f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u221e2c25\" id=\"u221e2c25\">本节我们主要来学习梯度的定义和梯度的求解, 然后利用Pytorch相关的函数,实现张量的梯度定义,梯度计算,梯度清空已经关闭梯度等操作</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"ff5ccb37\" id=\"ff5ccb37\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6ecbf202\" id=\"u6ecbf202\">梯度的计算</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u97ad137c\" id=\"u97ad137c\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"ue00c5c3a\" id=\"ue00c5c3a\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub289066f\" id=\"ub289066f\">在一元函数中,某点的梯度标的就说某点的导数. 在多元函数中某点的梯度表示的是由每个自变量所对应的偏导数所组成的向量.如 f(x,y,z) 的梯度向量就是</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub488bfce\" id=\"ub488bfce\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u08efa101\" id=\"u08efa101\" style=\"text-align: center\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"math\" value=\"data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20f%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20x%7D%2C%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20f%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20y%7D%2C%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20f%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20z%7D)%5Cn%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.yuque.com%2Fapi%2Fservices%2Fgraph%2Fgenerate_redirect%2Flatex%3F(%255Cfrac%257B%255Cpartial%2520f%257D%257B%255Cpartial%2520x%257D%252C%255Cfrac%257B%255Cpartial%2520f%257D%257B%255Cpartial%2520y%257D%252C%255Cfrac%257B%255Cpartial%2520f%257D%257B%255Cpartial%2520z%257D)%250A%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22p3w8I%22%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub5be2236\" id=\"ub5be2236\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u7f86aa5e\" id=\"u7f86aa5e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6220ae01\" id=\"u6220ae01\">梯度的方向就说函数值上升最快的方向</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u7a6d464b\" id=\"u7a6d464b\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub1e5b584\" id=\"ub1e5b584\" style=\"text-align: center\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"math\" value=\"data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7Bn%7D%5C%5Csum%203y_i%5E2%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%20%7B1%7D%7B3%7D(3y_1%5E2%20%2B%203y_2%5E2%20%2B%203y_3%5E2)%5Cn%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.yuque.com%2Fapi%2Fservices%2Fgraph%2Fgenerate_redirect%2Flatex%3Fz%2520%253D%2520%255Cfrac%257B1%257D%257Bn%257D%255Csum%25203y_i%255E2%2520%253D%2520%255Cfrac%2520%257B1%257D%257B3%257D(3y_1%255E2%2520%252B%25203y_2%255E2%2520%252B%25203y_3%255E2)%250A%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Xm9XQ%22%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"uf162e8c4\" id=\"uf162e8c4\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u919a9bc2\" id=\"u919a9bc2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u96701fdd\" id=\"u96701fdd\">我们一般可以使用</span><code data-lake-id=\"ua48f0955\" id=\"ua48f0955\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf1fef350\" id=\"uf1fef350\">torch.autograd.backward()</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uc5d4c122\" id=\"uc5d4c122\">来自动计算变量的梯度,该函数会对指定的变量进行偏导的求取.为了辨别函数中哪些变量需要求偏导,哪些不需要求偏导,我们一般会在定义张量时,加上requires_grad=True, 表示该变量可以求偏导</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u74aeb5ea\" id=\"u74aeb5ea\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22import%20torch%5Cnx%20%3D%20torch.randn(1%2C%20requires_grad%3DTrue)%5Cny%20%3D%20torch.randn(1)%5Cnz%20%3D%20torch.randn(1)%5Cn%5Cnf1%20%3D%202*x%20%2B%20y%5Cnf2%20%3D%20y%20%2B%20z%20%5Cn%5Cnprint(f1.grad_fn)%5Cnprint(f2.grad_fn)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%227b3cd49b%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ub45db6d6\" id=\"ub45db6d6\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"ubbfe30a6\" id=\"ubbfe30a6\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud746a1aa\" id=\"ud746a1aa\">从结果可以看出, x被定义成可以求偏导的变量, 因此, 它所对应的变量f1就是可求导的.</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u3fa6908c\" id=\"u3fa6908c\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"ud84373e1\" id=\"ud84373e1\"><span data-lake-id=\"u796fb6a4\" id=\"u796fb6a4\">接下来,我们利用</span><code data-lake-id=\"uca4f35c1\" id=\"uca4f35c1\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1a77b4c9\" id=\"u1a77b4c9\">f1.backward()</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u9b8cd033\" id=\"u9b8cd033\">求取f1的梯度(即所有变量的偏导), 然后利用</span><code data-lake-id=\"ubc75f4db\" id=\"ubc75f4db\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3504ce88\" id=\"u3504ce88\">x.grad</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u88aca9bb\" id=\"u88aca9bb\">获取</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u0a816f1e\" id=\"u0a816f1e\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"uc7cc2415\" id=\"uc7cc2415\" style=\"text-align: center\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"math\" value=\"data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20f_1%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20x%7D%5Cn%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.yuque.com%2Fapi%2Fservices%2Fgraph%2Fgenerate_redirect%2Flatex%3F%255Cfrac%257B%255Cpartial%2520f_1%257D%257B%255Cpartial%2520x%257D%250A%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zQC6c%22%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u3b9d1d12\" id=\"u3b9d1d12\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22f1.backward()%5Cnprint(x.grad)%20%23%20df1%2Fdx%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22539f9a7b%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u8940c7bb\" id=\"u8940c7bb\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u1a33b868\" id=\"u1a33b868\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8c23a5da\" id=\"u8c23a5da\">当然除了上面简单的一元函数求偏导外, 我们还可以使用上面的方法来求取复合函数的偏导:</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ufe5cbe7c\" id=\"ufe5cbe7c\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x%20%3D%20torch.randn(3%2C%20requires_grad%3DTrue)%20%23%20x%E4%B8%AD%E5%AD%98%E4%BA%86%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%AA%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8Fx1%2Cx2%2Cx3%5Cny%20%3D%20x%20%2B%202%5Cnz%20%3D%20y%20*%20y%20*%203%5Cnz%20%3D%20z.mean()%5Cnprint(z)%5Cnprint(z.grad_fn)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%2236c90325%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ue9cc9569\" id=\"ue9cc9569\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u95f001aa\" id=\"u95f001aa\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud1537439\" id=\"ud1537439\">根据上面的代码可知,我们定义了一个Z关于变量x的多元复合函数,如下:</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u940b5925\" id=\"u940b5925\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u7d111d71\" id=\"u7d111d71\" style=\"text-align: center\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"math\" value=\"data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22y%20%3D%20x%20%2B%202%5Cn%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.yuque.com%2Fapi%2Fservices%2Fgraph%2Fgenerate_redirect%2Flatex%3Fy%2520%253D%2520x%2520%252B%25202%250A%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cvmwW%22%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"uad9635a3\" id=\"uad9635a3\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u4a74a312\" id=\"u4a74a312\" style=\"text-align: center\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"math\" value=\"data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7Bn%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Bn%7D3y_i%5E2%5Cn%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.yuque.com%2Fapi%2Fservices%2Fgraph%2Fgenerate_redirect%2Flatex%3Fz%2520%253D%2520%255Cfrac%257B1%257D%257Bn%257D%255Csum_%257Bi%253D1%257D%255E%257Bn%257D3y_i%255E2%250A%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KnLAH%22%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u5d516cfe\" id=\"u5d516cfe\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub7ff82b0\" id=\"ub7ff82b0\"><span data-lake-id=\"u03e02064\" id=\"u03e02064\">我们手工计算一下z关于x的偏导数. 首先我们将z进行展开.</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u761f3304\" id=\"u761f3304\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u2aaf6d59\" id=\"u2aaf6d59\" style=\"text-align: center\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"math\" value=\"data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7Bn%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Bn%7D3y_i%5E2%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B3%7D(3y_1%5E2%20%2B%203y_2%5E2%20%2B%203y_3%5E2)%5Cn%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.yuque.com%2Fapi%2Fservices%2Fgraph%2Fgenerate_redirect%2Flatex%3Fz%2520%253D%2520%255Cfrac%257B1%257D%257Bn%257D%255Csum_%257Bi%253D1%257D%255E%257Bn%257D3y_i%255E2%2520%253D%2520%255Cfrac%257B1%257D%257B3%257D(3y_1%255E2%2520%252B%25203y_2%255E2%2520%252B%25203y_3%255E2)%250A%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PQbnY%22%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u37f60500\" id=\"u37f60500\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"uadd381f8\" id=\"uadd381f8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u34224ef7\" id=\"u34224ef7\">特别的, 我们计算z对于x1的偏导</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u179cbb5c\" id=\"u179cbb5c\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u6b90f4f5\" id=\"u6b90f4f5\" style=\"text-align: center\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"math\" value=\"data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20z%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20x_%7B1%7D%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20z%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20y_%7B1%7D%7D%20%5C%5Ccdot%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20y_%7B1%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20x_%7B1%7D%7D%5Cn%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.yuque.com%2Fapi%2Fservices%2Fgraph%2Fgenerate_redirect%2Flatex%3F%255Cfrac%257B%255Cpartial%2520z%257D%257B%255Cpartial%2520x_%257B1%257D%257D%2520%253D%2520%255Cfrac%257B%255Cpartial%2520z%257D%257B%255Cpartial%2520y_%257B1%257D%257D%2520%255Ccdot%2520%255Cfrac%257B%255Cpartial%2520y_%257B1%257D%257D%257B%255Cpartial%2520x_%257B1%257D%257D%250A%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BEZwn%22%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"ufdb21062\" id=\"ufdb21062\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u279333c2\" id=\"u279333c2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u96499be5\" id=\"u96499be5\">我们首先计算:</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uf33c5d79\" id=\"uf33c5d79\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"ua1f9ab62\" id=\"ua1f9ab62\" style=\"text-align: center\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"math\" value=\"data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20z%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20y_1%7D%5Cn%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.yuque.com%2Fapi%2Fservices%2Fgraph%2Fgenerate_redirect%2Flatex%3F%255Cfrac%257B%255Cpartial%2520z%257D%257B%255Cpartial%2520y_1%257D%250A%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QXceK%22%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u8e9f5f63\" id=\"u8e9f5f63\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u8d269f6d\" id=\"u8d269f6d\" style=\"text-align: center\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"math\" value=\"data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%20%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20z%7D%20%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20y_1%7D%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B3%7D%20%5C%5Ccdot%203%5C%5Ccdot2%20%5C%5Ccdot%20y_%7B1%7D%3D2y_1%5Cn%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.yuque.com%2Fapi%2Fservices%2Fgraph%2Fgenerate_redirect%2Flatex%3F%255Cfrac%2520%257B%255Cpartial%2520z%257D%2520%257B%255Cpartial%2520y_1%257D%253D%255Cfrac%257B1%257D%257B3%257D%2520%255Ccdot%25203%255Ccdot2%2520%255Ccdot%2520y_%257B1%257D%253D2y_1%250A%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hwh1G%22%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u38007fd8\" id=\"u38007fd8\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u7084710c\" id=\"u7084710c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u458a07ce\" id=\"u458a07ce\">接着计算:</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub5a19329\" id=\"ub5a19329\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u4c1f16f7\" id=\"u4c1f16f7\" style=\"text-align: center\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"math\" value=\"data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20y_1%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20x_1%7D%5Cn%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.yuque.com%2Fapi%2Fservices%2Fgraph%2Fgenerate_redirect%2Flatex%3F%255Cfrac%257B%255Cpartial%2520y_1%257D%257B%255Cpartial%2520x_1%257D%250A%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MlFs6%22%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u311e4909\" id=\"u311e4909\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u319d2bb3\" id=\"u319d2bb3\" style=\"text-align: center\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"math\" value=\"data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20y_1%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20x_1%7D%20%3D%201%5Cn%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.yuque.com%2Fapi%2Fservices%2Fgraph%2Fgenerate_redirect%2Flatex%3F%255Cfrac%257B%255Cpartial%2520y_1%257D%257B%255Cpartial%2520x_1%257D%2520%253D%25201%250A%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FyK5g%22%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"uc7cb6384\" id=\"uc7cb6384\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u9b3b8591\" id=\"u9b3b8591\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua73c5588\" id=\"ua73c5588\">最终:</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u47c31dab\" id=\"u47c31dab\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u8c805cbe\" id=\"u8c805cbe\" style=\"text-align: center\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"math\" value=\"data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20z%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20x_%7B1%7D%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20z%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20y_%7B1%7D%7D%20%5C%5Ccdot%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20y_%7B1%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20x_%7B1%7D%7D%20%3D%202y_1%20%5C%5Ccdot%201%20%3D%202(x_1%20%2B%202)%5Cn%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.yuque.com%2Fapi%2Fservices%2Fgraph%2Fgenerate_redirect%2Flatex%3F%255Cfrac%257B%255Cpartial%2520z%257D%257B%255Cpartial%2520x_%257B1%257D%257D%2520%253D%2520%255Cfrac%257B%255Cpartial%2520z%257D%257B%255Cpartial%2520y_%257B1%257D%257D%2520%255Ccdot%2520%255Cfrac%257B%255Cpartial%2520y_%257B1%257D%257D%257B%255Cpartial%2520x_%257B1%257D%257D%2520%253D%25202y_1%2520%255Ccdot%25201%2520%253D%25202(x_1%2520%252B%25202)%250A%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hURu1%22%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u4252290a\" id=\"u4252290a\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u9616881e\" id=\"u9616881e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9fae9f27\" id=\"u9fae9f27\">我们也可以使用z.backward()求取梯度, 该张量的梯度结果会被放在所对应的变量grad属性中.下面我们比较一下通过z.backward() 求取梯度和我们上面推导的结果是否一致</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ucb9b3d32\" id=\"ucb9b3d32\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22z.backward()%5Cnprint(x.grad)%5Cnprint(2*(x%20%2B%202))%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22baa0c636%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u0c62336a\" id=\"u0c62336a\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u6aaa9822\" id=\"u6aaa9822\"><span data-lake-id=\"u30b0d671\" id=\"u30b0d671\">上面结果为函数z的梯度向量,即函数z分别关于x1,x2,x3的偏导数.</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub8ea4929\" id=\"ub8ea4929\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u0c016f0d\" id=\"u0c016f0d\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub8acf5e5\" id=\"ub8acf5e5\">简单的说, torch.autograd.backward就是使用链式法则对变量的偏导进行了求解.该函数有一个参数grad_variables, 该参数相当于给原梯度进行了一个加权.</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ueb12f259\" id=\"ueb12f259\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"uf32c1019\" id=\"uf32c1019\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7e77f601\" id=\"u7e77f601\">如果使用函数k.backward(p)则得到的变量x.grad的值为:</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u86f0b90e\" id=\"u86f0b90e\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u8c944f2f\" id=\"u8c944f2f\" style=\"text-align: center\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"math\" value=\"data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x.grad%20%3D%20p%20%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cfrac%7Bdk%7D%7Bdx%7D%5Cn%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.yuque.com%2Fapi%2Fservices%2Fgraph%2Fgenerate_redirect%2Flatex%3Fx.grad%2520%253D%2520p%2520%255Ccdot%255Cfrac%257Bdk%257D%257Bdx%257D%250A%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ExH4R%22%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub7519df7\" id=\"ub7519df7\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x%20%3D%20torch.randn(3%2C%20requires_grad%3DTrue)%5Cn%5Cnk%20%3D%20x*2%5Cnfor%20_%20in%20range(10)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20k%20%3D%20k%20*%202%5Cn%5Cnprint(k)%5Cnprint(k.shape)%5Cnp%20%3D%20torch.tensor(%5B0.1%2C%201.0%2C%200.0001%5D%2C%20dtype%3Dtorch.float32)%5Cn%5Cnk.backward(p)%5Cnprint(x.grad)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bf57bdd9%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u65b724f7\" id=\"u65b724f7\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u5dacf863\" id=\"u5dacf863\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4b0b81a2\" id=\"u4b0b81a2\">停止张量的梯度计算</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ua32caeeb\" id=\"ua32caeeb\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u5e56260f\" id=\"u5e56260f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u469bbe34\" id=\"u469bbe34\">如果我们不需要某些张量的梯度计算, 我们就可以使用下面三种方法告诉计算机停止梯度的计算:</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ubf8c3658\" id=\"ubf8c3658\"><br></p><ul list=\"u315912fe\"><li fid=\"u64eeeaaf\" data-lake-id=\"u5677b24f\" id=\"u5677b24f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8b44a301\" id=\"u8b44a301\">x.requires_grad_(False)</span></li></ul><ul list=\"u2ff5f609\"><li fid=\"uebcceb2f\" data-lake-id=\"u039a35ac\" id=\"u039a35ac\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue789b083\" id=\"ue789b083\">x.detach()</span></li></ul><ul list=\"u64e995a7\"><li fid=\"u75c440aa\" data-lake-id=\"u17019a43\" id=\"u17019a43\"><span data-lake-id=\"uba814ca7\" id=\"uba814ca7\">with torch.no_grad()</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u34280c6e\" id=\"u34280c6e\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u69412020\" id=\"u69412020\"><span data-lake-id=\"u157cbff7\" id=\"u157cbff7\">利用x.requires_grad_(...) 就地更改现有标志</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uf0ff3aec\" id=\"uf0ff3aec\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22a%20%3D%20torch.randn(2%2C2%2Crequires_grad%3DTrue)%5Cnb%20%3D%20((a%20*%203)%2F(a%20-%201))%5Cnprint(b.grad_fn)%5Cna.requires_grad_(False)%5Cnb%20%3D%20((a%20*%203)%20%2F%20(a%20-%201))%5Cnprint(b.grad_fn)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22434c9989%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u52d2fd0d\" id=\"u52d2fd0d\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"uee277cac\" id=\"uee277cac\"><span data-lake-id=\"u18567425\" id=\"u18567425\">利用x.detach()获取具有相同内容但不能进行梯度计算的新张量</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uc0489cca\" id=\"uc0489cca\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22a%20%3D%20torch.randn(2%2C2%2Crequires_grad%3DTrue)%5Cnb%20%3D%20a.detach()%5Cnprint(a.requires_grad)%5Cnprint(b.requires_grad)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22146a5d1c%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ube22160e\" id=\"ube22160e\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"uec3ecea4\" id=\"uec3ecea4\"><span data-lake-id=\"uee227718\" id=\"uee227718\">在with torch.no_grad()的作用域中定义的都是不进行梯度计算的张量:</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u5b940392\" id=\"u5b940392\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22a%20%3D%20torch.randn(2%2C%202%2C%20requires_grad%3DTrue)%5Cnprint((a%20**%202).requires_grad)%5Cnwith%20torch.no_grad()%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20print((a%20**%202).requires_grad)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eedffa4e%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u8389ba67\" id=\"u8389ba67\"><br></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"edbc57f0\" id=\"edbc57f0\"><span data-lake-id=\"u74766243\" id=\"u74766243\">梯度的清空</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u682fff63\" id=\"u682fff63\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u857d9874\" id=\"u857d9874\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufb838572\" id=\"ufb838572\">在PyTorch中,如果我们利用torch.autograd.backward求解张量的梯度, 在多次运行该函数的情况下, 该函数会将计算得到的梯度累加起来.</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u05923543\" id=\"u05923543\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x%20%3D%20torch.ones(4%2C%20requires_grad%3DTrue)%5Cny%20%3D%20(2*x%20%2B%201).sum()%5Cnz%20%3D%20(2*x).sum()%5Cny.backward()%5Cnprint(%5C%22%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1%E5%81%8F%E5%AF%BC%3A%5C%22%2Cx.grad)%20%23%20dy%2Fdx%5Cnz.backward()%5Cnprint(%5C%22%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E6%AC%A1%E5%81%8F%E5%AF%BC%3A%5C%22%2Cx.grad)%20%23%20dy%2Fdx%20%2B%20dz%2Fdx%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%2218f9b643%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ue2ff67d0\" id=\"ue2ff67d0\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u913cdd54\" id=\"u913cdd54\"><span data-lake-id=\"uadb6e408\" id=\"uadb6e408\">从上面的结果可以看出,如果我们对张量y和z分别求梯度,那么他们关于x的偏导都会被放入x.grad中,形成累加的情况</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u8c9c81e8\" id=\"u8c9c81e8\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"ue3158624\" id=\"ue3158624\"><span data-lake-id=\"u35c72abe\" id=\"u35c72abe\">为了避免这种情况,一般我们在计算完梯度之后,都会清空梯度.在清空梯度后, 我们再进行其他张量的梯度求解.</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ufff85be9\" id=\"ufff85be9\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u1dbfe204\" id=\"u1dbfe204\"><span data-lake-id=\"u850b10ac\" id=\"u850b10ac\">我们可以使用</span><code data-lake-id=\"u74a1dbf1\" id=\"u74a1dbf1\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubd7c682d\" id=\"ubd7c682d\">x.grad.zero_()</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u6d3cacac\" id=\"u6d3cacac\">清空梯度:</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u5428253b\" id=\"u5428253b\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x%20%3D%20torch.ones(4%2C%20requires_grad%3DTrue)%5Cny%20%3D%20(2*x%20%2B%201).sum()%5Cnz%20%3D%20(2*x).sum()%5Cny.backward()%5Cnprint(%5C%22%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1%E5%81%8F%E5%AF%BC%3A%5C%22%2Cx.grad)%5Cnx.grad.zero_()%5Cnz.backward()%5Cnprint(%5C%22%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E6%AC%A1%E5%81%8F%E5%AF%BC%3A%5C%22%2Cx.grad)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%220a6a3dd8%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u786fcfd3\" id=\"u786fcfd3\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"uba85fd60\" id=\"uba85fd60\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf603d7c1\" id=\"uf603d7c1\">这个性质说非常重要的,在后面我们做梯度下降的时候会用到</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u45617794\" id=\"u45617794\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u27ec29cc\" id=\"u27ec29cc\"><span data-lake-id=\"u748a2377\" id=\"u748a2377\">因为我们训练模型时需要循环求梯度,如果这时梯度一直叠加, 那么我们求出来的结果就没有意义.因此,可以使用上面的方法对张量的偏导进行清空.</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u3d7013bb\" id=\"u3d7013bb\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub3dfaae5\" id=\"ub3dfaae5\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5d50f408\" id=\"u5d50f408\">除了张量中存在梯度清空函数,优化器中也存在这样的函数: zero_grad()</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uabda2b49\" id=\"uabda2b49\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22optimizer%20%3D%20torch.optim.SGD(%5Bx%5D%2C%20lr%3D0.1)%5Cnoptimizer.step()%5Cnoptimizer.zero_grad()%5Cnprint(optimizer)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22e525791b%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"uf7a76037\" id=\"uf7a76037\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"ue8d33cc5\" id=\"ue8d33cc5\"><span data-lake-id=\"u07ec0476\" id=\"u07ec0476\">这里提到的优化器,我们会在后面的学习中学到,这里先只要知道优化器也需要进行梯度清空即可</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uf10e82e6\" id=\"uf10e82e6\"><br></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"5db9fd7c\" id=\"5db9fd7c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0117c8fd\" id=\"u0117c8fd\">小结</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"ua0d473eb\" id=\"ua0d473eb\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u830bd07f\" id=\"u830bd07f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u61a547dc\" id=\"u61a547dc\">本节我们首先讲解了梯度的含义,然后利用PyTorch定义了可以自动求偏导的张量, 然后对张量进行了梯度求解, 最后阐述了梯度清空的重要性和必要性.</span></p>",
